# --- Evidence and derived artifacts ---
# Working copies, carved files, decoded output and session logs are produced by
# running the analysis; they are reproducible from the register and must not be
# committed. Manual §9 also forbids overwriting them, which git would do on a
# merge. The register itself IS committed -- it is the report's backbone.
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
!results/artifact-register.md

# Disk and memory images. These reach GB scale and github rejects >100MB.
*.dd
*.raw
*.img
*.E01
*.Ex01
*.aff4
*.vmem
*.mem
*.lime
*.pcapng.gz

# Recovered passwords and John state -- Manual §8.
*.pot
.john/

# --- LaTeX build output ---
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
main.pdf

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor / scratch ---
.idea/
*.swp
*~
scratch/
*.tmp
